     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If exacerbations persist, patients with eosinophilia may benefit from a biologic such as mepolizumab or dupilumab."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
