    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Ensifentrine (inhaled PDE3/PDE4 inhibitor, bronchodilator and anti-inflammatory) is an add-on for patients already on other bronchodilators; it may reduce exacerbation risk."
     }
    ]
   }
